  "solution": "<div class=\"with-figure\"><div>Gọi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>I</mi></semantics></math> là trung điểm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math>. Khi đó <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>I</mi><mo>∥</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>90</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></semantics></math> nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>I</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là hình vuông.<br>Khi đó <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>D</mi><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math> suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>△</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math> vuông tại <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>C</mi></semantics></math> hay <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>⊥</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Mà <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>⊥</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow></semantics></math>. Do đó <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>⊥</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Kẻ <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>⊥</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> (trong mặt phẳng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>). Suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>⊥</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>H</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Khi đó <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>⊥</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>. <br>Xét <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>△</mi><mi>S</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> vuông tại <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>A</mi></semantics></math> có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>H</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là đường cao và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></semantics></math>, <br><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>B</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi><msup><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></semantics></math> nên\n\t\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>H</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>S</mi><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>5</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac><mo>⇒</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>10</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\t\n\t\t\tVậy khoảng cách từ <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>A</mi></semantics></math> đến mặt <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>26</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.</div><div class=\"side-figure\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/68a1a75317547fea467a931866fcc24743f4be19ab9c1c460f2cd984729b87dc.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div></div>",
